        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Daniel moved to Valencia at thirty four with school Spanish and an app on his phone. For six months he understood the neighbours and answered in English. Then he learned the phrases people really use and booked a conversation every week.</p><p>He has taught adults online for seven years. Hablo is that way of learning, filmed. This is sample text; replace it with your own story.</p>"
          }
        },
