            "text": "Why the course exists"
          }
        },
        "heading_2": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Most courses teach grammar first and talking last"
          }
        },
        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Verb tables make good tests and rarely help in a café. The adults Daniel taught stalled in the same places: they understood more than they could say, and nobody gave them time to say it. The course fixes those first.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
